**Corollary 7.2 (conditional inertia reduction).** Under the supplied
FC34.3 dichotomy and the same finite jointly attained class, every
face with $t\ge\max(t_0,2000000000)$ has indefinite $R_-$.

Proof. FC34.3 leaves precisely an indefinite matrix or a nonzero
rank-one negative-semidefinite matrix in this range. The latter is
excluded by Theorem 7.1. This inference supplies neither a dual
nor a jointly attaining law when those have not been supplied.
$\square$

